&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;24 V in (F9) · 12 V via bus cable · front of row&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE3A2B;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;spacingTop=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="960" width="270" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lanes9" value="&lt;b&gt;7 × conveyor · CB002-24V-573mm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;24 V · ≤0.2 A no-load · 5.8 cm/s · ≤6 kg&lt;br&gt;Loaded/stall current and signal type TBC" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#171A1F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;spacingTop=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2930" y="960" width="240" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lc10" value="&lt;b&gt;LANECTRL-10&lt;/b&gt; · node 10 · bus entry&lt;br&gt;7 × H-bridge + TVS · 7 × feedback · 7 × button + LED on board&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#7C858E&quot;&gt;24 V in (F10) · 12 V via bus cable · front of row&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE3A2B;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;spacingTop=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="1060" width="270" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lanes10" value="&lt;b&gt;7 × conveyor · CB002-24V-573mm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;24 V · ≤0.2 A no-load · 5.8 cm/s · ≤6 kg&lt;br&gt;Loaded/stall current and signal type TBC" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#171A1F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;spacing=4;spacingTop=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2930" y="1060" width="240" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_note" value="LANECTRL boards sit behind the front metal bracket; reference DWG in MEC/01_CAD_MODELS. PCB fit and button/LED pitch require verification.&lt;br&gt;70 W27 motor/signal leads stay in rows; conveyor signal reference and reversal compatibility are unresolved.&lt;br&gt;For lane n = 1…70: row = floor((n−1)/7)+1; channel = ((n−1) mod 7)+1." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="1170" width="600" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#BE3A2B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; DC power (bold): 24 V / derived 12 V &amp;nbsp; ━━ AC / motor phases &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#1D5FA8&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; data / control &amp;nbsp; ┄┄ unconfirmed / wireless" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#D4D9E0;fillColor=#F0F2F5;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1390" width="1000" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tables_ref" value="&lt;b&gt;R27 companion:&lt;/b&gt; APDU_Electrical_Tables_R27.xlsx · direct sensor wiring; no junction boxes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Engineering HOLD:&lt;/b&gt; drive compatibility, converter selection, motor limits, protection and harness release. Retired cable IDs W02/W14/W22/W31/W32 are not fitted." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5158;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#D4D9E0;fillColor=#F7EEDC;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="1390" width="1500" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_ac24" value="W01 · AC" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=7;strokeColor=#171A1F;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;exitX=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="acin" target="psu24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" x="0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_24dist" value="W03 · 24 V" styl